{"v":1,"id":"6458be9c7465","synced":false,"offset":null,"source":"whisper","lines":[{"t":"In the dark, I remember A time before the world closed in","s":13.88,"e":21.42},{"t":"Child eyes, wide with wonder No shame, no mask, no whisper","s":21.42,"e":27.98},{"t":"And I felt your nearness in the quiet","s":27.98,"e":31.18},{"t":"Before the weight, the lies, the crowd","s":31.18,"e":34.62},{"t":"Years have passed, I learned the silence","s":34.62,"e":38.32},{"t":"Now I'm crying it out loud","s":38.32,"e":41.6},{"t":"Why does it take despair","s":41.6,"e":44.72},{"t":"To make me reach for you?","s":44.72,"e":48.3},{"t":"Longing, desperate, broken","s":49.38,"e":52.08},{"t":"Can I come back through?","s":52.08,"e":55.22},{"t":"Break me open","s":58.56,"e":61.0},{"t":"Peel away what I've become","s":61.92,"e":64.24},{"t":"I'm bleeding in the longing","s":65.24,"e":68.14},{"t":"To be desperate for your love","s":68.14,"e":71.46},{"t":"Let humility lead me","s":72.28,"e":75.16},{"t":"Confession be the start","s":76.0,"e":78.6},{"t":"I'm striving, I'm receiving","s":79.3,"e":81.78},{"t":"Let acceptance fill my heart","s":81.78,"e":85.74},{"t":"Looking back at innocence before I caged my soul away","s":91.12,"e":97.64},{"t":"Did you wait for me in shadows calling out my given name?","s":97.64,"e":104.84},{"t":"I traded gold for ashes, traded presents for control","s":105.02,"e":111.42},{"t":"But the love we had was endless","s":111.42,"e":115.52},{"t":"I want that love restored","s":115.52,"e":118.7},{"t":"Screaming for freedom","s":119.4,"e":120.64},{"t":"The echoes shake the walls","s":122.12,"e":124.92},{"t":"Bury the pride that's haunted me","s":126.0,"e":129.18},{"t":"Let me hear your call","s":129.7,"e":132.02},{"t":"Remind me of when laughter","s":133.0,"e":135.62},{"t":"Made I trusted you alone","s":135.62,"e":138.64},{"t":"Break me in the longing, Lord Bring this rebel heart","s":138.64,"e":146.06},{"t":"Break me open Peel away what I've become","s":146.64,"e":151.98},{"t":"I'm pleading in the longing To be desperate for your love","s":152.64,"e":159.36},{"t":"Let humility lead me Confession be the start","s":159.36,"e":166.26},{"t":"I'm striving, I'm receiving","s":166.26,"e":169.64},{"t":"Let acceptance fill my heart","s":169.64,"e":173.9},{"t":"Break me open","s":187.12,"e":190.84},{"t":"Peel away what I've become","s":191.7,"e":194.1},{"t":"I'm bleeding in the longing","s":194.1,"e":197.98},{"t":"To be desperate for your love","s":197.98,"e":201.44},{"t":"Let humility lead me","s":202.12,"e":205.08},{"t":"Confession be the star","s":205.88,"e":208.36},{"t":"I'm striving, I'm receiving","s":209.1,"e":211.7},{"t":"Let acceptance fill my heart","s":211.7,"e":215.56},{"t":"Every shadow, every echo","s":216.88,"e":220.82},{"t":"I face it just to see","s":220.82,"e":223.96},{"t":"The childhood fields","s":223.96,"e":226.2},{"t":"The honest tears","s":226.2,"e":227.66},{"t":"And how you still love me","s":227.66,"e":230.98},{"t":"In darkness and in mourning","s":230.98,"e":233.78},{"t":"Let me learn to truly trust","s":233.78,"e":237.18},{"t":"Abide here in your mercy","s":237.9,"e":240.84},{"t":"Your will is enough","s":242.2,"e":246.08},{"t":"Thanks for watching!","s":260.2,"e":263.54}],"match":null}
